🏈 RHYS DAKIN 🏈

Rhys Dakin is one of the brightest talents to emerge from Prokick Australia, and it’s been an absolute privilege to train him at Athlete Training ❤️

From the moment he walked through our doors, Rhys has demonstrated an incredible work ethic, resilience, and passion for getting better every day. His journey has been nothing short of inspiring, and his dedication has paid off in a big way 🚀

We’re beyond excited to see Rhys play for the Iowa Hawkeyes — a true testament to his hard work, skill, and relentless pursuit of excellence. This is just the beginning for Rhys, and we know he’s going to make waves when the season kicks off 💪🏼

Congratulations, Rhys! You’ve earned this incredible opportunity, and we can’t wait to watch you dominate on the field in America. Keep pushing forward and showing the world what you’re made of 🇺🇸

